  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/y8of9Gn.png\" width=\"749\" height=\"98\"></span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#000\"><strong>公告</strong></span></h3>\n<h3><del>感谢下载量达到500！</del>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3><del>感谢下载量达到1000！</del></h3>\n<h3><del>感谢下载量达到2000！</del></h3>\n<h3>感谢下载量达到5000！<br><br><span style=\"color:#000\">本模组是 mariot7 开发的 XL FOOD MOD 的移植版本。该模组为游戏添加了大量新食物和农作物！</span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\"><strong>功能：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#000\">8种新农作物</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#000\">150+种新食物</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#000\">新蛋糕</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#000\">新矿石与花卉</span></li>\n</ul>\n<div><span style=\"color:#000\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LBUUMBP.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"697\" height=\"65\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\">草丛与香草花：</span></p>\n<div>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\">香草草丛掉落模组内任意种子或花朵的概率相同。此外，模组的配置文件提供了禁用获取种子/花朵的功能选项。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/ktaqsU2.png\" alt=\"草丛与香草花在世界中自然生成\" width=\"900\" height=\"493\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\">使用香草花可以制作香草精，进而制成香草奶油：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/mzxAzcS.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://imgur.com/g8pZ5Qe.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\">岩盐：</span><span style=\"color:#19171c\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>岩盐可通过熔炼水桶获得。</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\">水稻、辣椒、玉米、黄瓜、生菜、洋葱、番茄与草莓植株：</span>&nbsp;</p>\n<div>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/WAmO3Ud.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"900\" height=\"493\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>水稻可用于制作米面包、炒饭和黄油饭：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/OFOl9iQ.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://imgur.com/JwMcZdH.png\" width=\"180\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/yNdAJE8.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>辣椒可用于制作辣酱：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/G0YPhBN.png\" width=\"180\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>生玉米可加工成玉米粒，用于制作玉米面包：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/VJAdrot.png\" width=\"180\" height=\"124\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://imgur.com/G13OoA5.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>番茄可用于制作番茄酱：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/PYWoyp2.png\" width=\"180\" height=\"124\"></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\">面团、奶酪等：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>面团、熟面团：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/qT5iRRz.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://imgur.com/G8nAfuH.png\" width=\"180\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>面包丁：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/lymgGQa.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>土豆面包：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/Mz0LsEI.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>法棍面包：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/TPAXpFC.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>黄油：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/ny362Gp.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>奶酪：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/b27TRKC.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>芝士球：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/FJqlqMw.png\" width=\"180\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>芝士面包：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/Rrlqi43.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>薯片、咸味薯片、辛辣薯片：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/E4By6jz.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/LTdaIq2.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/QZKGlG9.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>洋葱圈：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/IBYWBYA.png\" width=\"180\" height=\"124\"><